- **Note:** generated with `lv_font_conv` from a font whose redistribution
  terms permit embedding. Regenerate with `lv_font_conv` from the original
  font using the GB2312 range; do not include the ASCII range, or English
  text will render with the CJK face instead of the fallback font.

